Subject: [PATCH 01238/11171] [conductor] DECENTRALIZATION clean rerun on a
 STRONGER local base -- BUILD+LAUNCH (G3; split-long-codex BUILD half; clean
 replacement for the flagged exp4022): exp4012 measured gemma-4-12B best-of-N
 (k=8) at 0.2581 demo-perfect coverage = NO lift over the 3-attempt baseline
 (representational-gap-likely on the 12B). Per 'The Invisible Leash'
 (arXiv:2507.14843) the gap closes ONLY if the abstraction is LATENT in the
 base; a STRONGER local base may have it where 12B did not. Write the
 best-of-N runner for gemma-4-31B dense (or Qwen3.6-35B-A3B MoE -- pick by
 cache/throughput), smoke on 2 tasks, commit, then LAUNCH the full run
 BACKGROUNDED on the SAME 30-task ARC-1 pool as exp4012 (apples-to-apples).
 Time-budget/checkpoint the run; it must not hold an agent past the 80-min
 cap.

Automated research step by research conductor.
